      },
      "value": "This certifies that                                       is the registered holder of                                shares \nof                                     of                                               , transferable only on the books of the \nCorporation by the holder hereof in person or by duly authorized attorney upon surrender of this Certificate properly endorsed.",
      "autoScale": false
