        "height": "auto",
        "fontSize": "15em",
        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "center",
        "fontFamily": "Playfair Display, serif",
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "For value received,                                         hereby sells, assigns, and transfers \nunto                                                                  shares represented by this Certificate, and does hereby irrevocably constitute and appoint                                         as attorney to transfer the said shares on the books of the within-named Corporation with full power of substitution in the premises.",
